0034:                   
0034:                   * Here's how registers are set when this process is forked:
0034:                   *
0034:                   *   +-----------------+  <--  Y          (highest address)
0034:                   *   !   Parameter     !
0034:                   *   !     Area        !
0034:                   *   +-----------------+  <-- X, SP
0034:                   *   !   Data Area     !
0034:                   *   +-----------------+
0034:                   *   !   Direct Page   !
0034:                   *   +-----------------+  <-- U, DP       (lowest address)
0034:                   *
0034:                   *   D = parameter area size
0034:                   *  PC = module entry point abs. address
0034:                   *  CC = F=0, I=0, others undefined
0034:                   
0034:                   * The start of the program is here.
0034:                   * Before any command line processing is done, we clear out
0034:                   * our static memory from U to cleartop, then determine the
0034:                   * size of our data area (minus the stack).
0034: 3450              start    pshs  u,x              save registers for later
0036: 30C80C                     leax  <cleartop,u      point to end of area to zero out
0039:                            IFNE  H6309
0039:                            subr  u,x              subtract U from X
0039:                            tfr   x,w              and put X in W
0039:                            clr   ,-s              put a zero on the stack
0039:                            tfm   s,u+             and use TFM to clear starting at U
0039:                            leas  1,s              clean up the stack
0039:                            ELSE
0039: 3410                       pshs   x               save end pointer on stack
003B: 6FC0              clrnxt   clr   ,u+              clear out
003D: 11A3E4                     cmpu  ,s               done?
0040: 26F9                       bne   clrnxt           branch if not
0042: 3262                       leas  2,s              else clear stack
0044:                            ENDC
0044: 3550                       puls  x,u              and restore our earlier saved registers
0046: 31C9004C                   leay  bigbuff,u        point Y to copy buffer offset in U
004A: 9F00                       stx   <parmptr         save parameter pointer
004C: 109F02                     sty   <bufptr          save pointer to buffer
004F: 1F40                       tfr   s,d              place top of stack in D
0051:                            IFNE  H6309
0051:                            subr  y,d
0051:                            ELSE
0051: 3420                       pshs  y                save Y on stack
0053: A3E1                       subd  ,s++             get size of space between copybuf and X
0055:                            ENDC
0055: 830180                     subd  #STACKSZ+PARMSZ  subtract out our stack
0058: DD04                       std   <bufsiz          size of our buffer
